OL,3,ATrump, Putin, and Xi issue 'joint
OL,4,Adeclaration on peace' after 90-minute
OL,5,Atalks in China
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump, Vladimir Putin, and Xi
OL,8,FJinping issue a "joint declaration on
OL,9,Fpeace" after 90-minute talks in China
OL,11,FThe statement says "nuclear war cannot
OL,12,Fbe won and must never be fought" - it
OL,13,Falso pledges to "increase the
OL,14,Fproduction of refined petroleum
OL,15,Fproducts"
OL,17,FIn footage released by the Kremlin of
OL,18,Fhim leaving the talks, Putin says to
OL,19,FXi: "I don't think anyone even expected
OL,20,Feverything to go so well"
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
