OL,5,Atalks in China
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier, Trump held separate, bilateral
OL,8,Fmeetings with Putin and Xi. He called
OL,9,Fthe Russian leader his friend - watch
OL,10,Fthe moment here
OL,12,FAfter meeting Xi, Trump said the US and
OL,13,FChina want to see an end to the Ukraine
OL,14,Fwar
